a 3 + antioxidantes + microbiota","guid":"DLXtHlscRcaEXkN6rt_f6Q","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"199","text":"UPP energia + proteinas + omega 3 + micronutrientes + control glicemico","guid":"HRpdRLRLTluevtjfad3RdQ","children":[]},{"id":"203","parent":"199","text":"Hilo comun TRABAJO MULTIDISCIPLINAR (medico + nutricionista + fonoaudiologo + enfermeria + KT + TO + familia)","guid":"unbU36LxSgayC5IbbhdQCg","children":[]}]},{"id":"204","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clinicas","guid":"6CMWrzQpRd2u82WHOMitVQ","children":[{"id":"205","parent":"204","text":"Perla 1 EAT-10 herramienta tamizaje universal disfagia (mayor 3 derivar, mayor 15 urgencia fono)","guid":"FfuIshsfS6-UMM1ox-Iuwg","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"204","text":"Perla 2 Framework IDDSI estandariza lenguaje (8 niveles 0-7) -> usar siempre nivel IDDSI X","guid":"CuSl1GMWT5Kg8rIxqYwgzg","children":[]},{"id":"207","parent":"204","text":"Perla 3 Test jeringa 10 mL metodo de bolsillo viscosidad (en 10 seg)","guid":"eajrmCWPRuCfDTYELVwosA","children":[]},{"id":"208","parent":"204","text":"Perla 4 GELATINA en disfagia se licua -> TRAMPA DE AGUA (error frecuente)","guid":"QOiKqOR2QlKF2UVez7qQUQ","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"204","text":"Perla 5 NUNCA dobles texturas (cazuelas, leche con galletas) -> aspiracion","guid":"bjKqpZZeSJuo55TvkXDFRA","children":[]},{"id":"210","parent":"204","text":"Perla 6 Metabolismo basal NO cambia en Alzheimer -> aporte calorico = no enfermo","guid":"y0hzvFaDRmu2-OwtMt675A","children":[]},{"id":"211","parent":"204","text":"Perla 7 Dieta MIND mayor DASH mayor Mediterranea en Alzheimer -> NO alcohol, frutos rojos, hoja verde","guid":"blIq7fsVQ0WoN4dhmTqisg","children":[]},{"id":"212","parent":"204","text":"Perla 8 Eje microbiota-intestino-cerebro (Lactobacillus reduce β-amiloide hipocampal)","guid":"Svnf_xfBRu2kBWwFcLqyWA","children":[]},{"id":"213","parent":"204","text":"Perla 9 MNA gold standard tamizaje nutricional mayores (aplicar al ingreso + cada 3 meses)","guid":"j