":"Documentos complementarios obligatorios Metodos de prueba + Evidencia + FAQ","guid":"Nc3UbO9aSPO3VZy2RorxqA","children":[]},{"id":"227","parent":"221","text":"Acceso completo iddsi.org/framework/","guid":"eKbvHeSjSXeylyHWN0238w","children":[]}]},{"id":"228","parent":"220","text":"Stefaniak y cols (Nutrients 2022;14:4564) dieta en prevencion Alzheimer","guid":"yuCVIXeVTHaHN6cqvMxBjg","children":[{"id":"229","parent":"228","text":"Alzheimer = 60-80% de los casos de demencia","guid":"XA02PLjARgW6yUtjhtP36w","children":[]},{"id":"230","parent":"228","text":"Tratamiento farmacologico solo alivia sintomas -> factores estilo de vida MODIFICAN riesgo","guid":"M5QWv0djQ0OetpY_dpO1CQ","children":[]},{"id":"231","parent":"228","text":"Dieta debe ser rica en neuroprotectores antioxidantes + vitaminas B + PUFAs","guid":"byOdwDpYRl2tESHW3BYojw","children":[]},{"id":"232","parent":"228","text":"3 patrones con efecto beneficioso documentado Mediterranea, DASH y MIND","guid":"dq8atrSqT-mR40dPHKQGYQ","children":[]},{"id":"233","parent":"228","text":"Pocos estudios analizan distribucion de macronutrientes (la evidencia es por nutriente o grupo)","guid":"ARf-VzGYSuOYqpcqxpObDA","children":[]}]},{"id":"234","parent":"220","text":"Kreindl, Basfi-fer, Rojas y Carrasco (Rev Chil Nutr 2019;46(2):197-204) tratamiento nutricional UPP y UV","guid":"xuDLSGOWTGSvntEBzrmCdw","children":[{"id":"235","parent":"234","text":"En Chile 70% de heridas cronicas son ULCERAS VENOSAS (UV)","guid":"F3mR_n4KQMyKxBuGleVvNA","children":[]},{"id":"236","parent":"234","text":"Prevalencia UPP en hospitalizados Chile 28%","guid":"ePq5TVJIQTOt6wixHNsJ0g","children":[]},{"id":"237","parent":"234","text":"Ambas (UPP y UV) aumentan requerimientos energeticos, proteicos y micronutrientes","guid":"0_vLzBc3QreYp2XjZ-dQcw","children":[]},{"id":"238","parent":"234","text":"Terapia nutricional mantencion/aumento de peso + proteinas adecuadas + suplementacion focalizada","guid":"4ZcgHsYwSG6_nHZBDplfyQ","children":[]},{"id"