,"children":[]}]}]},{"id":"250","parent":"0","text":"Casos Autoestudio (oficiales Nta Munoz)","guid":"3_msDSnoTPizn1rzhQj2Pw","children":[{"id":"251","parent":"250","text":"Caso 1 hombre 81a secuelado ACV, disfagia IDDSI 3, espesado con chuno mala palatabilidad -> deshidratacion","guid":"5Owhuxu7Th-739qNprRN1g","children":[{"id":"252","parent":"251","text":"Objetivo mantener hidratacion segura sin aspiracion","guid":"GZOxXnpGQEm-1cXo4CFuOQ","children":[]},{"id":"253","parent":"251","text":"Estrategias ajustar/cambiar espesante, mejorar sabor (citrico, hierbas, temperatura), fraccionar volumenes, supervision activa, reevaluar progresion","guid":"2SFktkGkRoOGmro1KrxvaQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"254","parent":"250","text":"Caso 2 mujer 85a demencia moderada, doble textura, EAT-10 = 6, perdida 4 kg en 2 meses, tolera pure","guid":"gsO9fhVIT0uNhaLkCN5aFQ","children":[{"id":"255","parent":"254","text":"Interpretacion EAT-10 mayor o igual 3 y menor 15 = alteracion deglucion","guid":"3jghq7kQRqu2_ELl1hvbOQ","children":[]},{"id":"256","parent":"254","text":"Objetivo prevenir neumonia aspirativa, desnutricion, sarcopenia","guid":"1LKTKusQQSK5yJ_LRWRtMw","children":[]},{"id":"257","parent":"254","text":"Intervencion derivar fonoaudiologia + IDDSI nivel 4 pure (sin doble textura, sin niveles 5-6 no controlados) + MNA + nutricionista densidad energetica/proteica + hidratacion monitorizada","guid":"lGXnqnPTQ-2bHqGFEcvK2g","children":[]}]},{"id":"258","parent":"250","text":"Caso 3 Alzheimer mujer 75a inicial + HTA + RI + sobrepeso + perdida masa muscular","guid":"aNCCRePhR8yX5lsX_Rr0zw","children":[{"id":"259","parent":"258","text":"Recomendacion Dieta MIND (Mediterranea + DASH)","guid":"cfmtiofXTy61cQmP6sWHyg","children":[]},{"id":"260","parent":"258","text":"Vegetales hoja verde, frutos rojos, grasas monoinsaturadas; reducir carnes rojas, azucares refinados, sodio","guid":"j_9ZEiWTRlGdR6pfTlnG9g","children":[]},{"id":"261","parent":"258","text":"Evaluar pre/probioticos","guid":"dAIqYlpSTueeiJcR2hD1Rw","children":[]},{"id":"262","parent":"258","text":"Mecanismos menor estres oxidativo, menor neuroinflamacion, mejor sensibilidad insulina, posible menor acumulacion beta-amiloide, microbiota produce neurotransmisores","guid":"hORDA9MRSeK6LYcIYUQk_w","children":[]}]},{"id":"263","parent":"250","text":"Caso 4 Alzheimer moderado hombre 82a perdida 6 kg en 3 meses + distraccion + comidas mayor 1 h, IMC 23,5","guid":"7jQppOMCSM6fMcgFqPtSoQ","children":[{"id":"264","parent":"263","text":"Causas funciones ejecutivas alteradas, apraxia alimentaria, fatiga, olvido, cambios gusto/olfato","guid":"5qPZOihuSDmfEntLBbLSYg","children":[]},{"id":"265","parent":"263","text":"Intervencion reducir distractores, comidas pequenas y frecuentes, aumentar densidad energetica (aceite, leche en polvo, mantequilla frutos secos), utensilios adaptados, supervision directa, evaluar disfagia asociada","guid":"_OHz7Jd7TV2ijSA2z5ZbIQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"266","parent":"250","text":"Caso 5 UPP hombre 67a dismovilizado 5a, UPP estadio 3 sacra + UPP incipiente talon, deficit Zn + proteinas + vit D + anemia, IMC 21,8","guid":"NLFBHcunQCauZmucLqVdNQ","children":[{"id":"267","parent":"266","text":"Si suplementar Zinc (deficit demostrado, rol en regeneracion celular e inmunidad)","guid":"MIl3t8vWSI21yKfG8PMqmQ","children":[]},{"id":"268","parent":"266","text":"Otros micronutrientes clave vit C, vit A, vit E, selenio, cobre","guid":"6aDjiN8QTA2TlMGJE5LqvQ","children":[]},{"id":"269","parent":"266","text":"Suplementacion universal NO concluyente -> individualizar segun deficit","guid":"NY9A6l_sSQyPpRLqW0Sgcg","children":[]}]},{"id":"270","parent":"250","text":"Caso 6 UPP institucionalizado 77a estadio III sacra + deficit masa muscular + HTA + DM2 + dislipidemia, dieta ELEAM alta HC y baja proteina","guid":"aKcBTBOITMO5B7u-QqDK9A","children":[{"id":"271","parent":"270","text":"Modificacion HC 45-55% VCT complejos + fibra, evitar azucares refinados; proteinas 1,2-1,5 g/kg/dia; lipidos 25-35% omega-3","guid":"yP57lZAgR9WRbY9MCBxyQQ","children":[]},{"id":"272","parent":"270","text":"Fundamento hiperglicemia deteriora sintesis colageno via AGEs (recambio colageno tipo I) -> control glicemico = cicatrizacion; mas proteinas = mejor sintesis tisular + inmunidad; omega-3 = antiinflamatorio","guid":"dcjxN7yvQdG2nmEFJmFLnw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"273","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (oficiales del curso)","guid":"_SCp_CAxQiii9H2Rlf1Umw","children":[{"id":"274","parent":"273","text":"1. International Dysphagia Diet Standardisation Initiative (IDDSI). Marco y descriptores v2.0. Julio 2019 (trad. esp. Natalia Badilla Ibarra). iddsi.org","guid":"8-lo14NLRMS0W2DmwSN-bQ","children":[]},{"id":"275","parent":"273","text":"2. Stefaniak O, Dobrzynska M, Drzymala-Czyz S, Przyslawski J. Diet in the prevention of Alzheimer's disease: current knowledge and future research requirements. Nutrients 2022;14(21):4564.","guid":"F-JZ6bnyREWcsNksS151bg","children":[]},{"id":"276","parent":"273","text":"3. Kreindl C, Basfi-fer K, Rojas P, Carrasco G. Tratamiento nutricional en ulceras por presion y ulceras venosas. Rev Chil Nutr 2019;46(2):197-204.","guid":"fPb5fQk3QvKzpOM--1NjGA","children":[]},{"id":"277","parent":"273","text":"4. Belafsky PC, Mouadeb DA, Rees CJ, et al. Validity and reliability of the Eating Assessment Tool (EAT-10). Ann Otol Rhinol Laryngol 2008;117(12):919-24.","guid":"86SykHFnQlyu20oiJcAYHA","children":[]},{"id":"278","parent":"273","text":"5. Morris MC, Tangney CC, Wang Y, et al. MIND diet associated with reduced incidence of Alzheimer's disease. Alzheimers Dement 2015;11(9):1007-14.","guid":"PTRHYwjnSqicCYGw2e9yzg","children":[]},{"id":"279","parent":"273","text":"6. EPUAP/NPIAP/PPPIA. Prevention and treatment of pressure ulcers/injuries: clinical practice guideline. 2019.","guid":"Whf2boaoTAO0AmzL4dL_Jw","children":[]},{"id":"280","parent":"273","text":"7. Vellas B, et al. The Mini Nutritional Assessment (MNA) and its use in grading the nutritional state of elderly patients. Nutrition 1999;15(2):116-22.","guid":"ECHgNDG-QbCcMC2FJMpSmg","children":[]},{"id":"281","parent":"273","text":"8. Marik PE, Flemmer M. The immune and inflammatory basis for the pathogenesis of pressure ulcers and the role of n-3 polyunsaturated fatty acids. Crit Care Med 2010.","guid":"pM0y6mYoQI-LvKL6ZJt_Mg","children":[]}]}]},"node_count":281,"relations":[],"cross_references":[],"specialty":"Geriatría","folder":"Entidades clínicas/Geriatría","filename":"UTD VGI-2024","id":"map_162","resolved_references":[]}